## Purpose

This license lets you use and share this software for free, without limitation,
if you are an individual, a researcher, a creator, a nonprofit, or a small
business as defined below. Larger organizations need a paid commercial license.

The intent is plain: people learning, researching, and making things should
never have to pay or ask. Companies that have raised real money or earn real
revenue should.

## Acceptance

In order to receive this license, you must agree to its rules. Those rules are
both obligations under that agreement and conditions to your license. Do not do
anything with this software that triggers a rule you cannot or will not follow.

